@@ -0,0 +1,134 @@
+# Feature Specification: Copy and Clear Prompt Buttons
+
+**Feature Branch**: `feat/reference-image`
+**Created**: 2026-02-03
+**Status**: Implemented
+**Input**: User request: "Add copy and erase buttons under auto prompt generation button"
+
+## User Scenarios & Testing *(mandatory)*
+
+### User Story 1 - Copy Prompt to Clipboard (Priority: P1)
+
+As a user working on image generation prompts, I want to copy my prompt to the clipboard so I can reuse it in other contexts or share it with others.
+
+**Why this priority**: Core utility feature that saves users time when creating similar images or sharing effective prompts.
+
+**Independent Test**: Can be tested by entering a prompt, clicking the copy button, and pasting in another application.
+
+**Acceptance Scenarios**:
+
+1. **Given** a floating textarea with a non-empty prompt, **When** user clicks the copy button, **Then** the prompt is copied to clipboard and a success toast appears
+2. **Given** a floating textarea with an empty prompt, **When** user views the copy button, **Then** the button is disabled
+3. **Given** a floating textarea during generation, **When** user views the copy button, **Then** the button is disabled
+
+---
+
+### User Story 2 - Clear Prompt (Priority: P1)
+
+As a user who wants to start fresh with a new prompt, I want to quickly clear the current prompt so I don't have to manually select and delete the text.
+
+**Why this priority**: Core utility feature that improves workflow efficiency, especially when iterating on different prompt ideas.
+
+**Independent Test**: Can be tested by entering a prompt, clicking the clear button, and verifying the textarea is empty.
+
+**Acceptance Scenarios**:
+
+1. **Given** a floating textarea with a non-empty prompt, **When** user clicks the clear button, **Then** the prompt is cleared immediately
+2. **Given** a floating textarea with an empty prompt, **When** user views the clear button, **Then** the button is disabled
+3. **Given** a floating textarea during generation, **When** user views the clear button, **Then** the button is disabled
+
+---
+
+### User Story 3 - Consistent Button Layout (Priority: P2)
+
+As a user familiar with the auto-complete sparkle button, I want the copy and clear buttons to be positioned consistently in the same area so the interface feels cohesive.
+
+**Why this priority**: Good UX requires consistent placement of related actions.
+
+**Independent Test**: Can be tested by visually verifying button positions match the design reference.
+
+**Acceptance Scenarios**:
+
+1. **Given** a floating textarea with all three buttons enabled (auto-complete, copy, clear), **When** user views the textarea, **Then** buttons appear in a horizontal row in the top-right corner
+
+---
+
+### Edge Cases
+
+- What happens when the prompt contains only whitespace? → Buttons should be disabled (treated as empty)
+- What happens when clipboard API fails? → Error should be handled gracefully (copy fails silently)
+- What happens when isAutoCompleting is true? → All action buttons are disabled
+
+## Requirements *(mandatory)*
+
+### Functional Requirements
+
+- **FR-001**: System MUST display a copy button in the floating textarea when `onCopyPrompt` callback is provided
+- **FR-002**: System MUST display a clear button in the floating textarea when `onClearPrompt` callback is provided
+- **FR-003**: Copy button MUST be disabled when prompt is empty or whitespace-only
+- **FR-004**: Clear button MUST be disabled when prompt is empty or whitespace-only
+- **FR-005**: Both buttons MUST be disabled during generation (`isGenerating=true`)
+- **FR-006**: Both buttons MUST be disabled during auto-completion (`isAutoCompleting=true`)
+- **FR-007**: Clicking copy button MUST copy prompt to system clipboard
+- **FR-008**: Clicking clear button MUST set prompt value to empty string
+- **FR-009**: System MUST show success toast after successful copy operation
+- **FR-010**: Both buttons MUST have accessible aria-labels and tooltips
+
+### Key Entities
+
+- **FloatingTextarea**: UI component that contains the prompt input and action buttons
+- **FloatingTextareaContainer**: Container component that provides callbacks and state management
+
+## Implementation Details
+
+### Props Added to FloatingTextareaPropsGenerate
+
+```typescript
+/** Callback when user clicks copy prompt button */
+onCopyPrompt?: () => void;
+/** Tooltip text for copy prompt button */
+copyPromptTooltip?: string;
+/** Callback when user clicks clear prompt button */
+onClearPrompt?: () => void;
+/** Tooltip text for clear prompt button */
+clearPromptTooltip?: string;
+```
+
+### i18n Keys Added
+
+- `floatingTextarea.copyPromptTooltip` - Tooltip for copy button
+- `floatingTextarea.copyPromptSuccess` - Success toast message
+- `floatingTextarea.clearPromptTooltip` - Tooltip for clear button
+
+### Localization Support
+
+- English (en)
+- Japanese (ja)
+- Simplified Chinese (zh-CN)
+- Traditional Chinese (zh-TW)
+
+## Success Criteria *(mandatory)*
+
+### Measurable Outcomes
+
+- **SC-001**: Users can copy prompt to clipboard with a single click
+- **SC-002**: Users can clear prompt with a single click
+- **SC-003**: All unit tests pass (13 test cases covering button rendering, disabled states, and click handlers)
+- **SC-004**: No TypeScript errors in modified files
+- **SC-005**: Feature works consistently across all supported locales
+
+## Test Coverage
+
+Unit tests are located at:
+`tests/unit/components/canvas/floating-textarea-buttons.test.tsx`
+
+Test cases cover:
+- Copy button rendering when callback is provided
+- Copy button not rendering when callback is not provided
+- Copy button disabled states (empty prompt, generating, auto-completing)
+- Copy button click handler
+- Clear button rendering when callback is provided
+- Clear button not rendering when callback is not provided
+- Clear button disabled states (empty prompt, generating, auto-completing)
+- Clear button click handler
+- All three buttons (auto-complete, copy, clear) rendering together
